Package: ou-asterisk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, asterisk-core-sounds-en
Conflicts: asterisk, asterisk-modules, asterisk-config
Replaces: asterisk, asterisk-modules, asterisk-config
Provides: asterisk (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Asterisk 22 LTS PBX, Office Unbound build (minimal PJSIP module set)
 Asterisk built from the signature-verified upstream 22.12.0 release tarball
 with a minimal module set: PJSIP (TLS/WSS transports), SRTP and DTLS-SRTP,
 WebSocket, ulaw/alaw/GSM, file-based voicemail, CSV CDR, builtin dialplan.
 Not built: chan_sip, IAX2, MGCP, Skinny, unistim, DAHDI, ARI, FAX, ODBC and
 LDAP resources. pjproject 2.17 is bundled (statically linked into
 res_pjproject.so). The service is installed but not started; site
 configuration (transports, certificates) goes to /etc/asterisk/ou/.
 Unmodified upstream source; the matching .dsc and orig tarball are published
 with the package.
